---
import { marketplace } from '../lib/catalog';
const repo = marketplace.repo;
---

<div class="note">
  <p class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--accent)">No plugins yet</p>
  <p>The catalogue is empty. This page is generated from the repository, so the first
    plugin merged into <code>plugins/</code> appears here without anyone editing the
    site.</p>
  <p>The repository docs below are already indexed and searchable.</p>
  {repo && (
    <p>
      <a class="button" href={`https://github.com/${repo}/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md`}>How to add one</a>
    </p>
  )}
</div>
